WEBVTT

00:03:57.316 --> 00:04:00.861
But if we are to flip that scenario,

00:04:01.946 --> 00:04:05.825
and therefore make learning the constant

00:04:05.825 --> 00:04:08.160
and time variable,

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:10.454
then we break the tyranny of time.

00:04:11.289 --> 00:04:13.666
I mean, really, isn't that
what school is about?

00:04:13.708 --> 00:04:16.002
It's about learning and gaining mastery,

00:04:16.043 --> 00:04:19.213
versus logging in
a particular number of hours.

00:04:20.965 --> 00:04:22.925
So what could we do?

00:04:24.218 --> 00:04:30.182
We should make and give academic credit
for life experiences.